\newlabel{fig:pcd_pipeline}{{4}{7}{Observation pipeline at three episode stages. Each row: (a)~RGB, (b)~depth, (c)~segmented depth, (d)~3D back-projection, (e)~FPS point cloud with predicted grasp target (green~=~hit, red~=~miss). Top: dense pile; middle: partially cleared; bottom: sparse endgame}{figure.caption.6}{}}
